
# <type>(<scope>): <description>       72 characters at most, in English
#
# <body: what changes and why, not how>
#
# <footer: Closes #27, Refs: <sha>, BREAKING CHANGE: ...>
#
# type:  feat fix refactor chore docs test ci build perf style
# scope (required): server app recommender design doc repo,
#        several as server,app
# description: imperative, lowercase, no period at the end
# breaking change: ! after the scope, plus a BREAKING CHANGE: footer
# revert: "revert(#<PR number>): <header of the reverted commit>",
#         body says why,
#         footer Refs: <sha of the reverted commit>
#
# See doc/conventions.md.
